 }
 ```
+
+#### Liquid glass
+
+The refractive rim can be adjusted with `refraction` and `refraction-width`.
+`refraction` controls displacement strength, while `refraction-width` is the width of the optical rim in logical pixels.
+`chromatic-aberration` controls red/blue separation in logical pixels, and `highlight` controls the directional specular rim.
+Set all four values to `0` for the traditional blur-only appearance.
+
+```kdl
+blur {
+    refraction 0.18
+    refraction-width 24
+    chromatic-aberration 1
+    highlight 0.22
+}
+```
